{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "b544b999be8ad671bd9194c7b29c1d901e70917e8c2e4a226e606449ad8e61ad", "ja": "あっ、すみません、別の着信が。一度切りますね！\nもしもし？　あ、はい……え、都心のタワマン！？", "zh": "啊，不好意思，又有别的电话打进来了。我先挂了！\n喂？啊，好……诶，市中心的高层公寓！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "febf884c4b11b588bdf64cb91e4352aa2227fec4f1ad52f552f3c75538178925", "ja": "そんな予算ないですよ？　や、儲かってませんし……\nっと、また別の着信！？　すみません、これで！", "zh": "我们可没有那种预算啊？不，根本没赚到钱……啊，又有别的来电！？不好意思，我先挂了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "f46a8cc4894e60cecf044c449c561cf62ef9d2111bb9f010e427c640064e0033", "ja": "もしもーし！　2畳のワンルーム？　なんですかそれ！\nはい、もしもし！　事故物件！？　結構でーす！！", "zh": "喂——！2榻榻米的单间？那是什么啊！\n喂，你好！凶宅！？不用了——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
