{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "108953ec5ceda28fd21ed690f00f0499c49aab67921424b36a6f6f46f924ceee", "ja": "とはいえ、紬のためにも妥協できない。\nよし、次の電話ではしっかり条件を伝え直そう！", "zh": "不过，为了紬，也不能妥协。\n好，下一通电话一定要把条件重新说清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1013_se", "source_sha256": "36be0285cfb59f820089103968805b2b6da4c7c02c24e9fcdbffa17c9c170ab1", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ！", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
