{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "5752c48b7c6e88c8d9a2c821ca04d1a31726903ddb6e363e148d25e6b752548b", "ja": "はい……はいっ！　もちろんです！　歌織さんのことは\n責任を持って……はい！　き、肝に銘じますっ！！", "zh": "是……是的！当然！关于歌织的事，我一定会负起责任……是！我会牢记在心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "d1a74a7db7a5da7010212a3301a7392bc1ce222e4916b6a73225fda83530af51", "ja": "わざわざご丁寧に、ありがとうございます！\n……いえっ、そんな。……あはは、ご冗談を……。", "zh": "特意劳烦您提醒，非常感谢！\n……不、没那回事。……啊哈哈，您真会开玩笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "0e5df5f821b7f93042b6b94d35009360295f8d2503b42261a056abdc6999a9c3", "ja": "あ、はい、それでは失礼します！　はい、\n今後ともよろしくお願いいたします……。", "zh": "啊，好的，那我先告辞了！好的，今后也请多多关照……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "2774695a30321a0f85c1d9b3857f7706c5bee1c30264e4043e9d46bc94eceb0f", "ja": "はぁ～～～～っ……。", "zh": "哈～～～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1021_president", "source_sha256": "8e075fd7ac4276d74abd3e6ce0ee090de72b9d5da26afed844fa76fe3ae1ce5a", "ja": "おやおや、えらく青い顔をしてるじゃないか。\n白石君の部屋探しで、ずいぶん苦戦しているようだね。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，脸色苍白得厉害啊。\n看来你在帮白石找房子这件事上，似乎遇到了不少困难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "22864f0ca257db577ad40f343aeac9b248b74bc3413121b3ddbcb89816ee1987", "ja": "あっ、社長。はい、ちょっと……\n今はあんまり物件が出回ってないみたいで。", "zh": "啊，社长。是的，有点……\n现在好像没什么房源在市面上流通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1023_president", "source_sha256": "2155c858c6fe01eba2d27d9531be40f8043f0aafcf15bcc33975e6600a7f0658", "ja": "ふむ。では、これなんてどうかな？", "zh": "嗯。那么这个怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "3a91f5d35e08b6757f0f6d6896bccb0c96d3fe4e9d674c05e41943007626bd5a", "ja": "え？　えーと……最寄り駅……間取り……ええっ！？\nこの条件で即日入居可！？　こんな物件、どこで！？", "zh": "诶？那个……最近的车站……房屋格局……诶！？\n满足这些条件居然当天就能入住！？这种房子，你是从哪里找到的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1025_president", "source_sha256": "94326de96367ab7498731bd1dc9a9f63830012f3dd31f0de886b2615779d454a", "ja": "ふふふ、まあ、長くこの業界にいると、\nいろいろなツテがあってね。", "zh": "呵呵，毕竟我在这个圈子里待久了，多少还是有些门路的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1026_president", "source_sha256": "c5114988ecf6096314064aa73c0a834a0ba018736960cc7c0498129d4f8b012a", "ja": "白石君のお父上には、私からも一言言っておくよ。\n幸い、古い友人でもあるからね。", "zh": "我也会去跟白石的父亲说一声。幸好，他也是我的老朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "b89c17f5a375ae8654efd0aae8ae799ef434ffa0320f9600cec79e23a71b8b53", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！　というか、すみません。\n俺、なんか空回ってばっかりで……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您！不对，应该说，真是抱歉。\n我总是一个劲儿地白忙活……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1028_president", "source_sha256": "e788cb7e37d7922900017545f102dbaa9543e622e4fc28bd7e93ccdfe99cb9a4", "ja": "いや、気にすることはない。むしろ、\nひたむきで素晴らしいと思うよ？　結構結構！", "zh": "不，没什么好在意的。倒不如说，\n我觉得你认真投入的样子很棒哦？很好很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "92384d5144574ef490f15bba49f0eb0ac1b9694b17417aa637bc65caba43be3a", "ja": "そうですか？　でも俺……", "zh": "是吗？可是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1030_se", "source_sha256": "36be0285cfb59f820089103968805b2b6da4c7c02c24e9fcdbffa17c9c170ab1", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ！", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "64dcd5e778f22fba5210e58b519a563ee9d7c07fec1c4ea0e211bca031ffaabb", "ja": "っと、また電話だ。もう物件は見つかったって\n伝えないと……あれ、歌織さん？　もしもし？", "zh": "等等，又来电话了。得告诉对方已经找到房子了……咦，歌织小姐？喂？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1032_052kao", "source_sha256": "969c57c450d4fd3c5a6eab6c6ec8787b42511e67cfd837d4de8ffa186301b1ef", "ja": "あの、プロデューサーさん、すみません！\nさっき父から失礼があったみたいで……。", "zh": "那个，制作人，实在对不起！\n刚才家父似乎对您失礼了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_06_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "bb8679100fff47a185912b1f1582e544b7dc7add063f4b81c746dc5caada2714", "ja": "いえ、失礼なんてとんでもない！　俺のほうこそ、\n不甲斐ないところを見せてしまって、申し訳なくて……", "zh": "不，完全没有失礼这回事！倒是我，\n表现得那么不中用，实在是很抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
